---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = "Call for creatives: get featured in STRUKT";
const description = "Lighting, rigging, sound, visuals, sets, fashion or art for nights out? Get featured in STRUKT. Free, open to creatives anywhere, and aliases are welcome.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description}>
<main id="page-call">

  <section class="copen" aria-labelledby="h-call">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="folio mono"><span>Call for creatives</span><span>Open now</span><span>p. 02</span></div>
      <div class="grid cgrid">
        <div class="ctext">
          <svg class="t dots" data-text="OPEN CALL" data-o='{"drop":0.08,"stray":22,"seed":8,"color":"#000000","keyline":true}' role="img" aria-label="Open call"></svg>
          <h1 id="h-call">Show us what you made.</h1>
          <p>We're looking for the first people to feature in STRUKT. You don't need a big name, a festival résumé or a following, just work you're proud of.</p>
          <a href="#form">Start your submission</a>
        </div>
        <figure class="cphoto">
          <div class="photo dk reveal"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470229722913-7c0e2dbbafd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=70" alt="A single stage light cutting over a concert crowd" loading="lazy" decoding="async" onerror="this.closest('.photo').classList.add('noimg')"></div>
          <svg class="scatter dots" data-scatter='{"seed":31,"w":420,"h":420,"clusters":3,"min":40,"max":110,"density":0.6,"strays":20,"keyline":0.6,"pal":[["#8C52FF",5],["#000000",3],["#FFFFFF",2]]}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
          <figcaption class="mono">Photo: Yvette de Wit, Unsplash</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="steps" aria-labelledby="h-steps">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="h-steps">What happens after you send it</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><svg class="dots" data-text="1" data-o='{"drop":0,"stray":3,"seed":1,"color":"#8C52FF","keyline":true,"sub":3}' aria-hidden="true"></svg><p>You send the form. It takes about five minutes.</p></li>
        <li><svg class="dots" data-text="2" data-o='{"drop":0,"stray":3,"seed":2,"color":"#8C52FF","keyline":true,"sub":3}' aria-hidden="true"></svg><p>We look at every submission ourselves.</p></li>
        <li><svg class="dots" data-text="3" data-o='{"drop":0,"stray":3,"seed":3,"color":"#8C52FF","keyline":true,"sub":3}' aria-hidden="true"></svg><p>If it's a fit, we set up an interview however suits you: a video call, voice notes or in writing.</p></li>
        <li><svg class="dots" data-text="4" data-o='{"drop":0,"stray":3,"seed":4,"color":"#8C52FF","keyline":true,"sub":3}' aria-hidden="true"></svg><p>You see your feature before it goes live.</p></li>
        <li><svg class="dots" data-text="5" data-o='{"drop":0,"stray":3,"seed":5,"color":"#8C52FF","keyline":true,"sub":3}' aria-hidden="true"></svg><p>It's published, and you're credited and tagged.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="free">
    <svg class="dots scatter" data-scatter='{"seed":41,"w":520,"h":420,"clusters":3,"min":40,"max":110,"density":0.6,"strays":16,"x0":0.3,"keyline":0.6,"pal":[["#000000",4],["#C9B3FF",3],["#FFFFFF",1]]}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <p>Being featured is free, and it always will be.<span>Nobody pays to be in STRUKT. All we ask for is the work and the story behind it.</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="formsec" id="form" aria-labelledby="h-form">
    <div class="wrap grid">
      <div class="formside"><div class="sticky">
        <h2 id="h-form">The form</h2>
        <p>Eight questions. Answer the way you'd talk to someone outside the venue after load-out. We care about the work, not the polish.</p>
        <p>We only use your details to contact you about STRUKT.</p>
        <div class="nom"><b>Know someone who should be here?</b><p>Nominate them. Pick "someone else" in the first question and tell us about their work.</p></div>
      </div></div>

      <div class="formcol">
        <div class="prog8" aria-live="polite"><div class="pdots" id="pdots" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="mono" id="ptext">2 of 8 answered</p></div>
        <form id="cf" action="https://formspree.io/f/maeebnbb" method="POST" novalidate data-astro-reload>
          <div class="q"><span class="n">01</span><div class="body"><fieldset>
            <legend>Who are you submitting?</legend>
            <div class="chips">
              <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="for" value="me" checked><span>Myself</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="for" value="other"><span>Someone else</span></label>
            </div></fieldset></div></div>

          <div class="q"><span class="n">02</span><div class="body">
            <span class="l" style="font:600 clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.6rem)/1.2 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.025em;display:block;margin-bottom:.8rem" id="who-l">Who should we credit?</span>
            <div class="pair">
              <div><label for="name" id="name-l">Name or artist name</label><input type="text" id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required aria-describedby="name-e"><p class="err" id="name-e"></p></div>
              <div><label for="email">Email</label><input type="email" id="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required aria-describedby="email-e"><p class="err" id="email-e"></p></div>
            </div></div></div>

          <div class="q"><span class="n">03</span><div class="body">
            <span style="font:600 clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.6rem)/1.2 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.025em;display:block;margin-bottom:.8rem">Where can we find you?</span>
            <div class="pair">
              <div><label for="ig">Instagram</label><input type="text" id="ig" name="ig" placeholder="@handle"></div>
              <div><label for="city">City</label><input type="text" id="city" name="city" placeholder="Vancouver, anywhere"></div>
            </div></div></div>

          <div class="q"><span class="n">04</span><div class="body"><fieldset aria-describedby="what-e">
            <legend id="what-l">What do you do?</legend>
            <p class="hint">Pick everything that fits.</p>
            <div class="chips" id="what">
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Lighting"><span>Lighting</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Rigging"><span>Rigging</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Sound"><span>Sound</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Visuals and VJ"><span>Visuals and VJ</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Set and stage design"><span>Set and stage design</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Art and installations"><span>Art and installations</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Fashion"><span>Fashion</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Photo and video"><span>Photo and video</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Graphic design"><span>Graphic design</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Production"><span>Production</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="DJ or producer"><span>DJ or producer</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" name="what" value="Something else"><span>Something else</span></label>
            </div>
            <p class="err" id="what-e"></p></fieldset></div></div>

          <div class="q"><span class="n">05</span><div class="body">
            <label class="l" for="link">Show us the work</label>
            <p class="hint">A portfolio, Instagram, Drive folder or video. The work itself, not just the poster.</p>
            <input type="url" id="link" name="link" placeholder="https://" required aria-describedby="link-e">
            <p class="err" id="link-e"></p></div></div>

          <div class="q"><span class="n">06</span><div class="body">
            <label class="l" for="story" id="story-l">Tell us about something you made for a night</label>
            <p class="hint" id="story-h">What was it, what did you do, and what went wrong that nobody noticed?</p>
            <textarea id="story" name="story" maxlength="800" required aria-describedby="story-h story-c story-e"></textarea>
            <p class="count" id="story-c">0 / 800</p>
            <p class="err" id="story-e"></p></div></div>

          <div class="q"><span class="n">07</span><div class="body"><fieldset>
            <legend>How would you like to be interviewed?</legend>
            <div class="chips">
              <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="fmt" value="Video call" checked><span>Video call</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="fmt" value="Voice notes"><span>Voice notes</span></label>
              <label class="chip"><input type="radio" name="fmt" value="In writing"><span>In writing</span></label>
            </div></fieldset></div></div>

          <div class="q"><span class="n">08</span><div class="body">
            <span style="font:600 clamp(1.25rem,2vw,1.6rem)/1.2 var(--sans);letter-spacing:-.025em;display:block;margin-bottom:.6rem">Last thing</span>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="alias"><span>Feature me under an alias. Some of the best people in this scene don't use their real name, and that's fine.</span></label>
            <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="ok" name="ok" required aria-describedby="ok-e"><span id="ok-t">I made this work or have permission to share it, and STRUKT can contact me about a feature.</span></label>
            <p class="err" id="ok-e"></p></div></div>

          <div class="sr" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty<input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
          <div class="submit">
            <button type="submit">Send submission</button>
            <p>We read every one ourselves.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="err" id="send-e" role="alert"></p>
        </form>

        <div class="done" id="done" hidden tabindex="-1">
          <svg class="dots scatter" data-scatter='{"seed":51,"w":320,"h":300,"clusters":2,"min":40,"max":90,"density":0.6,"strays":14,"keyline":0.6,"pal":[["#8C52FF",4],["#C9B3FF",2]]}' aria-hidden="true"></svg>
          <svg class="dots t" data-text="RECEIVED" data-o='{"drop":0.04,"stray":12,"seed":6,"color":"#8C52FF","keyline":true}' role="img" aria-label="Received"></svg>
          <h2>Got it.</h2>
          <p>We read every submission ourselves. If it's a fit, we'll message you about an interview. Until then, follow @struktmag and tag us in your work.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
